PREFIX rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#>
PREFIX och: <http://w3id.org/def/och#>
PREFIX ex: <http://myexampleuri.org/data#>

<http://myexampleuri/removeObjectProperty/testproperty> rdf:type och:RemoveObjectProperty .
<http://myexampleuri/removeObjectProperty/testproperty> och:removedObjectProperty ex:testproperty .
<http://myexampleuri/removeDomain/testdomain> och:removedDomainFromProperty ex:testproperty .
<http://myexampleuri/removeDomain/testdomain> och:removedDomain ex:testdomain .
<http://myexampleuri/removeRange/testrange> och:removedRangeFromProperty ex:testproperty .
<http://myexampleuri/removeRange/testrange> och:removedObjectRange ex:testrange .